{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10009_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a9ccb675c531f47db4c9adbf4afd6148c60f75efc998167350f55c3cee338648",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6449fd5c7d6c10998b7fb47fc3315e5acc3194377c03c56827bc4b4b97c66980",
      "text": "让各位久等了。那支CM的\n合作歌曲Demo和歌词送到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51142cfe3f11f0d701621b02ca0ee8caa847ce384dc1fff69e37a5af7d4e35f5",
      "text": "谢谢！\n大吾君、一希先生，我们快听听看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000054:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7790c3e027f79bea3bf8aa30a4ce68d67418a889479946d8eeb57211100d7",
      "text": "这就是咱们的新歌……对于全新创立的\n礼服品牌来说，真是再合适不过的曲子了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1076240c8bcf3237c7b0dac846e5597188c28e2f3b2bddf1577c7d0ba1ac79df",
      "text": "歌词也很棒呢。同样的“♪”，\n有时念作“Love”，有时又念作“Happy”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e408d9e48b171577ad0c3e9afb9364a232df46e092e6cd75c7468387aa8a87d3",
      "text": "……啊，挺有趣的歌词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd67cd4acdd9c6ee52188f17af0aca810d0a540e81fb5f0fda6ef144019b5d77",
      "text": "嗯！\n真想早点和大家一起演唱这首歌啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b76aa51e518fe685d3eb131563bbb46de6945ec846294f405cc20cae3819ab4",
      "text": "（F-LAGS是为了实现梦想、改变自己而迈出崭新一步的三人组合……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:463ff43c5c0d1ce88bda967eb9584ded5eca254a15bb0f6a78df480147ae34e5",
      "text": "（和勇于挑战新事物的客户契合度真是完美极了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
